The Safety-Critical Infrastructure Governance system is unchanged but now incorporates the Observer-Institution Gap formally: all tiered response protocols must specify the maximum Δ_OI tolerable for each level of response. Level 3 (safety-critical joint response) and Level 4 (existential threat) must not rely solely on digital twin state; they require real-time sensor confirmation within a maximum Δ_OI tolerance.

